    <string-array name="demo_note_texts">
        <item>Let\'s start with the delivery schedule for Ulsan plant 2.</item>
        <item>Sure, I have the schedule in front of me.</item>
        <item>Parts arrived three days late, so delivery has to move to November 28.</item>
        <item>Please send the customer the change notice today.</item>
        <item>I will send the notice this afternoon.</item>
        <item>We need two more inspectors. They can start next Monday.</item>
        <item>We will reissue the quote at 3 percent above the current price.</item>
        <item>I will put together the reasons for the increase.</item>
        <item>Please upload the supporting data for the increase by Friday.</item>
        <item>The site safety check is set for Thursday at 10 a.m.</item>
        <item>We will continue at the same time next week.</item>
    </string-array>

