    </string-array>
    <string-array name="demo_material_highlights">
        <item>Ulsan plant 2 delivery November 28 | Parts delayed 3 days</item>
        <item>3 percent above the current price | Valid until December 15</item>
    </string-array>
    <string name="demo2_meeting_title">Line expansion technical review</string>
    <string-array name="demo2_note_speakers">
        <item>Choi, principal</item>
        <item>Jung, manager</item>
        <item>Me</item>
        <item>Han, researcher</item>
        <item>Choi, principal</item>
        <item>Me</item>
        <item>Jung, manager</item>
        <item>Han, researcher</item>
        <item>Me</item>
        <item>Choi, principal</item>
        <item>Jung, manager</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="demo2_note_texts">
        <item>Let\'s start with the Hwaseong line expansion.</item>
        <item>Equipment delivery has slipped a week, to the 10th of next month.</item>
        <item>I will check the delivery date with the supplier again.</item>
        <item>We decided on option 2 for the cooling unit.</item>
        <item>Please get two more quotes by Friday.</item>
        <item>I will share a quote comparison by Thursday.</item>
        <item>Commissioning will need about five people.</item>
        <item>Safety training is on the 18th at 2 p.m. in the main conference room.</item>
        <item>I will take care of the attendee list.</item>
        <item>Good. That\'s all for today.</item>
        <item>Thank you, everyone.</item>
    </string-array>
